        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Baird",
        "text": "*sigh*"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Baird",
        "text": "I'm at my limit."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_863_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Baird",
        "text": "I really am... so tired."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_863_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Baird",
        "text": "Well, at the very least, the Glasgow Gang managed to reunite while I'm still here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Baird",
        "text": "I hope they can all get away safely."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird staggers to a wall, and slowly sits herself down, drawing a long bloodstain behind her."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her hand is already going numb. She tries to make a fist, but to no avail."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Baird",
        "text": "Hah."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Baird",
        "text": "Ugh... death sure hurts a lot more than I had imagined. Hurts more than when Hannah socked me in the jaw."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "She turns her head and spots a corpse not far from her. Lean and emaciated, he seems to have died a few days ago."
    },
    {
        "text": "It suddenly occurs to her how familiar the corpse's face is."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Baird",
        "text": "So this is where you ended up, Mr. 'Next Academician.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "A can of meat lay close to the timid citizen, its contents completely cleaned out without even a little bit remaining."
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird blinks a few times at something strange by the poor man's side. From the wall to the floor is... a bunch of black curvy lines?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Words and diagrams."
    },
    {
        "text": "Only now does Baird realize that he had picked up another pen to write with\u2014 a battered charcoal pencil, a tool far less respectable than his precious fountain pen."
    },
    {
        "text": "She touches her own pocket. The fine fountain pen that had belonged to him is still with her. It's a shame McClaren never read the final words written by this gorgeous pen."
    },
    {
        "text": "She manages to drag her body with some difficulty towards the writing on the wall, and carefully makes out the tiny handwriting."
    },
    {
        "text": "She laughs, and also starts coughing."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Baird",
        "text": "A thesis on heraldry as an application to be a Fellow of the Royal Victorian Academy of Sciences?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Baird",
        "text": "Mister, you chose to write <i>this</i> of all the other things you could have written?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Baird",
        "text": "It's totally useless."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird skips over the long, stupefying paragraphs of research and references."
    },
    {
        "text": "The paper ends abruptly. After a blank page is an angry note from the man on how he had forgotten some important material he wanted to add."
    },
    {
        "text": "His desperation shows through the broken writing that eventually fades off the page."
    },
    {
        "text": "At some point, he seems to have begun writing his wishes instead."
    },
